WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
I think Xiaolin's business has been pretty good these two days.

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,780
But you really should work harder

3
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,500
There seems to be a coffee shop opening opposite

4
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:06,780
Spend some time on the street

5
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:09,260
Is it my destiny to open another convenience store every day?

6
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:11,180
But I think it shouldn’t be a big problem

7
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:13,740
Good morning, boss

8
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,580
Boss, your coffee is amazing.

9
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,260
I was very energetic all afternoon after drinking yesterday.

10
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:18,660
Thirty yuan a bottle is not expensive

11
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,220
It’s more used than the cafe we bought before.

12
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,500
Boss, stop chatting now.

13
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,980
Let’s settle the accounts first. I’m still busy at work.

14
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:29,520
Come on, come on, take it yourself

15
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:32,120
Why did Xiaolin's business suddenly improve?

16
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:34,930
How much money can you make from a few bottles of coffee?

17
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:36,850
Waiting for the coffee shop opposite to open

18
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:37,810
See what he does

19
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:39,330
Boss, let’s go first

20
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:41,190
Welcome to the next branch
